stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Created
  Created --> Available: makeAvailable [prerequisites resolved, guard true]
  Created --> Skipped: skip [guard false or dead path]
  Created --> Cancelled: cancel
  Available --> Assigned: assign
  Available --> Cancelled: cancel
  Assigned --> InProgress: start
  Assigned --> Escalated: escalate (no response)
  Assigned --> Cancelled: cancel
  Escalated --> Assigned: assign (next level / supervisor)
  Escalated --> InProgress: start
  Escalated --> Cancelled: cancel
  InProgress --> Completed: complete
  InProgress --> Rejected: reject [reason]
  InProgress --> Suspended: suspend
  InProgress --> Cancelled: cancel
  Suspended --> InProgress: resume
  Suspended --> Cancelled: cancel
  Completed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  Skipped --> [*]
